          "text": "Description: A witness reports observing on November 4, 1977, at approximately 6:15 PM, a bright ball moving in a southerly to northerly direction (SO-NE). No such phenomenon was observed by the weather station and radar at Base Aerienne 105 in Evreux. Regional press reports two other individuals witnessed the same phenomenon, but we have no further information.",
